    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d403">

                <pb facs="0374" n="364" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg364"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/7–649: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Taipei</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Edgar</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Taipei</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-07-06T10:00:00+09:00">July 6, 1949—10 a.
                            m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received July 6—9:06 p. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>270. Military conference over and according Governor Chen many things decided “in
                    principle”. Cited one his problems as Chinese Generals with American surface but
                    no depth whose advice if followed would spell disaster for Chinese military. I
                    wished his armies same success American armies under American system. Governor
                    then said I would be pleased to know Taiwan forces were to be reduced to two or
                    three armies to insure adequate food, housing, training et cetera.</p>
                <p>Sun Li-jen also at July reception reiterated disillusionment, said conference
                    produced nothing but words. He was returning immediately to Fengshan but would
                    again be in Taipei in a few days to tell me something.</p>
                <p>Sent Department 270; repeated Canton 114.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Edgar</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
